#!/command/with-contenv bash
# Mirrors custom_recording.service. Defined but not started at boot (see
# SERVICES), matching install_services.sh, which installs the unit without
# enabling it. Start it from the stock UI's service controls if you use it.
exec s6-setuidgid birdnet \
  env HOME=/home/birdnet USER=birdnet \
  /usr/local/bin/custom_recording.sh
